{"id":"n15643-3-9","stage":3,"title":"빠뜨리다 · 落","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15643-3-9-1","ko":"주머니에 넣어 둔 펜이 없어졌어.","zh":"我放在口袋里的笔不见了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주머니에","meaning":"衣袋，衣兜","explanation":"주머니：衣袋，衣兜；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주머니","audio":"/audio/5739db1617eef912c0b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75803","senseId":"2","lemma":"주머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주머니에","audio":"/audio/d30ac73d72f116237ee8.mp3"}},{"text":"넣어","meaning":"放进，装进","explanation":"넣다：放进，装进；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"1","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넣어","audio":"/audio/5917140fe7e2cfbda3f8.mp3"}},{"text":"둔","meaning":"表示前面动作结果的持续进行。","explanation":"두다：表示前面动作结果的持续进行。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48279","senseId":"1","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"둔","audio":"/audio/116fbf2f245c5cf6c9f8.mp3"}},{"text":"펜이","meaning":"笔","explanation":"펜：笔；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"펜","audio":"/audio/e414ad855b8d4825e031.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81973","senseId":"2","lemma":"펜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"펜이","audio":"/audio/bfcdd1a771443eb23a92.mp3"}},{"text":"없어졌어.","meaning":"没有；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"없다：没有；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어졌어","audio":"/audio/8b5f252a29ba6ca3869f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5739db1617eef912","term":"주머니","zh":"衣袋，衣兜","audio":"/audio/5739db1617eef912c0b4.mp3","entryId":"75803","definition":"缝在衣服上用以装钱或物的部分。","pronunciation":["주머니"]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"放进，装进","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"使进入某个空间里。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"表示前面动作结果的持续进行。","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"48279","definition":"表示前面动作结果的持续进行。","pronunciation":["두다"]},{"id":"e414ad855b8d4825","term":"펜","zh":"笔","audio":"/audio/e414ad855b8d4825e031.mp3","entryId":"81973","definition":"指圆珠笔、签字笔等书写工具。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/51b5f97edd3a1aeb2694.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15643-3-9-2","ko":"어디에 빠뜨린 거 아냐?","zh":"是不是掉哪儿了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디에","audio":"/audio/c24ae324e24a5ebc5c5e.mp3"}},{"text":"빠뜨린","meaning":"落，掉，遗漏","explanation":"빠뜨리다：落，掉，遗漏；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"빠뜨리다","audio":"/audio/60b6a0afa0c7703051cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15643","senseId":"3","lemma":"빠뜨리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빠뜨린","audio":"/audio/81c926cd5bf319a45aea.mp3"}},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}},{"text":"아냐?","meaning":"以为","explanation":"알다：以为；냐：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"12","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아냐","audio":"/audio/775fa206224d591e4b76.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"60b6a0afa0c77030","term":"빠뜨리다","zh":"落，掉，遗漏","audio":"/audio/60b6a0afa0c7703051cd.mp3","entryId":"15643","definition":"将携带着的东西遗落丢失。","pronunciation":["빠ː뜨리다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"以为","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于某个事实，认为或觉得如此。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6dcdb7a2f51ff9fcb263.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.98,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15643","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":107,"sequenceScore":2.8067,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是不是掉哪儿了？","我放在口袋里的笔不见了。","这项工作绝对不能出任何差错。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我放在口袋里的笔不见了。","这项工作绝对不能出任何差错。","是不是掉哪儿了？"],"answer":2}]}
